OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening to come with plenty of late
OL,7,Fsunshine, followed by a dry and clear
OL,8,Fnight. Light winds expected throughout
OL,9,Fwith mild, locally warm, overnight
OL,10,Ftemperatures.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA dry day on Sunday and
OL,13,Ffeeling hot in the sunny spells. Some
OL,14,Fpatchy cloud developing in the
OL,15,Fafternoon, but still plenty of
OL,16,Fsunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
