OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FTurning very warm and humid from
OL,7,FMonday with an increasing chance of
OL,8,Fshowers. These heavy and potentially
OL,9,Fthundery at times. Feeling very warm
OL,10,Fin the sunny spells and light winds.
